# Using SpecGate

A Git repository whose root contains `.specgate/` is governed by SpecGate:
load one lifecycle phase before writing repository files. When the user
mentions SpecGate, load `specgate`. For lifecycle work, load exactly one setup,
preparation, or delivery phase before a write. Read-only concept and
troubleshooting questions stay in the root skill. Do not apply the SpecGate
lifecycle to generic specifications or work that is not tied to SpecGate.
